<td style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;" valign="top" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"> 
<table style="width: 100%;" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" width="100%"> 
<table class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;" border="0" width="560" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td style="width: 100%;" align="center" valign="top" width="100%"> 
<table style="width: 100%;" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;" align="center" valign="top" width="100%"> <p style="width: 100%; height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;" align="left" valign="top" width="100%"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Hello {{lead.First Name:default= }},<br>‌<br></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">We are very excited to see you at <strong>Ellucian E-Live 2023 </strong>in New Orleans! Please be sure to add these sessions to your conference schedule and reserve your seat now:</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><br><a href="https://elive.ellucian.com/flow/ellucian/elive23/elive23homepage/page/sessioncatalog?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=WorthTheRisk3&amp;tab.day=20230328&amp;search=flywire"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Innovates to Easily Connect All Receivables with Ellucian</u></strong></span></a> <br><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Tuesday, March 28th from 11:30am - 12:50pm CDT</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><em>Jennifer Lightfoot, Executive Director, Texas A&amp;M University</em><br><em>David King, Chief Technology Officer, Flywire</em></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong>Flywire’s cutting-edge technology now seamlessly links to partnered Ellucian solutions</strong>, allowing higher education institutions direct access to Flywire's extensive global payment network and education solution to <strong>easily manage domestic and international payments, payment plans, and student financial data—all within their Ellucian instance.</strong> Hear how <strong>Texas A&amp;M is leveraging Flywire's technology</strong> to improve the overall payment experience for students regardless of location.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><a href="https://elive.ellucian.com/flow/ellucian/elive23/elive23homepage/page/sessioncatalog?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=WorthTheRisk3&amp;tab.day=20230328&amp;search=flywire"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>[DEMO] An Inside Look at How Flywire’s Education Solution Drives Payment Success</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Tuesday, March 28th from 2:20 - 2:35 pm CDT</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><em><span style="color: #223341;">Paul Huizenga, Director, Technical Sales Support, Flywire</span></em></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Looking forward to seeing you there!<br>‌</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong>The Flywire Team</strong> (Booth #916)</p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
